[[Teien Casterwill]] used this spell in [[Huntik International HQ]] to call her Cypherdex, revealing to the other council members that she was a secret [[Casterwill family]] member. {{source|S2E37}}

[[Sophie Casterwill]] used the spell on the longest night of the year to call her Cypherdex and transmit the location of the [[Spiral Mark]] to the [[Huntik Foundation]] [[Scramjets]]. {{Source|S2E49}} During the final battle with [[the Betrayer]], Sophie used it again so that she could find the real prophecies of [[Nostradamus]]. {{Source|S2E52}}

